description.p:
Figure 1 : Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 24 hours of milling of 5% Compound A and 2.5 % HPC-SL after 5 days stability in the cold; Figure 2: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 48 hours of milling of 5% Compound A and 2.5 % HPC-SL after 5 days stability in the cold; 

Figure 3 : Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 24 hours of milling of 5% Compound A, 2.5% HPC-SL, and 0.4% polyvinylpyrrolidone (PNP) after 5 days stability in the cold; Figure 4: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 48 hours of milling of 5% Compound A, 2.5% HPC-SL, and 0.4% after 5 days stability in the cold; Figure 5 : Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 24 hours of milling of 5% Compound A and 2.5% HPC-SL after 2 weeks stability in the cold; Figure 6: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 48 hours of milling of 5%> Compound A and 2.5% HPC-SL after 2 weeks stability in the cold; Figure 7: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 24 hours of milling of 5% L-807,067, 2.5% HPC-SL, and 0.4% PNP after 2 weeks stability in the cold; Figure 8: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 48 hours of milling of 5% Compound A, 2.5% HPC-SL, and 0.4% PNP after 2 weeks stability in the cold; Figure 9: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 24 hours of milling of 5% Compound A and 2.5% HPC-SL after 1 month stability in the cold; Figure 10: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 48 hours of milling of 5% Compound A and 2.5% HPC-SL after 1 month stability in the cold; Figure 11 : Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 24 hours of milling of 5% Compound A, 2.5% HPC-SL, and 0.4% PNP after 1 month stability in the cold; Figure 12: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 48 hours of milling of 5% Compound A, 2.5% HPC-SL, and 0.4% PNP after 1 month stability in the cold; 

Figure 13 : Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 24 hours of milling of 5%> Compound A and 2.5%. HPC-SL after 4 months stability in the cold; and Figure 14: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 48 hours of milling of 5% Compound A and 2.5% HPC-SL after 4 months stability in the cold. Figure 15 : Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 24 hours of milling of 5%. Compound A and 2.5% HPC-SL after 7 months stability in the cold. Figure 16: Shows a photomicrograph of a nanoparticulate composition produced after 48 hours of milling of 5% Compound A and 2.5% HPC-SL after 7 months stability in the cold.
